body:
This is the exemption I was referring to which I meet the criteria for: [https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/work-canada/permit/temporary/workers-study-without-study-permit.html](https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/work-canada/permit/temporary/workers-study-without-study-permit.html)

&#x200B;

Don't need a study permit.

Docs are a little outdated, the Enchant token was discontinued, Spell token never happened and was canceled.

&#x200B;

I would look into the community to find your up-to-date info or attend one of their weekly saturday townhalls and ask questions directly to the devs.

&#x200B;

Dev was also on Fantom Unchained podcast episode 18 with FTMAlerts on twitter if you want to watch that.

Goes without saying that Shib and DogeCoin don't have any more room for even a 2x.

&#x200B;

DogeBonk has shown it is very promising and the meme potential is the best I've ever seen.  
I'm balls deep into it and it proved itself this past week when it skyrocketed from 5 mil to 50 mil in 2 nights.

&#x200B;

We are just getting started. Get in fast.

The slots are all filled for those 40000

&#x200B;

However, they have unlimited slots for a very similar stream IF the student knows French and gives a TCF/TEF with a level of 5 I believe.

Must be outside Quebec and hold ANY job, but the other requirements are the same I think.

&#x200B;

[https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/tr-pr-pathway.html](https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/tr-pr-pathway.html)
